<title>USA: TABLE - Aviva Petroleum Q2 loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Aviva Petroleum Q2 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>AVIVA PETROLEUM INC AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data, unaudited)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					 June 30,	    June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	   1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Oil and gas sales    $2,339	$3,876    $5,553     $7,409</p>
<p>Write-down of oil and</p>
<p>   gas properties     11,413	   ---    13,399	  ---</p>
<p>     Total expense    14,401	 3,567    19,634	7,281</p>
<p>Debt refinancing expense</p>
<p>				 ---	   ---	 ---	(100)</p>
<p>     Net loss	 (11,610)	   (3)  (14,036)	(455)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	   31,483	31,483    31,483     31,483</p>
<p>Net loss per common</p>
<p>  share		   (0.37)	(0.00)    (0.45)     (0.01)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the six-month write-down of $13.4 million was equivalent to $0.43 per share, which it said was the major factor contributing to its loss.</p>
<p>The companmy's full name is Aviva Petroleum Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
